    Bug 1892531 - Async subfolder creation. r=BenC,babolivier

    Adds two methods to nsIMsgFolder – one takes a listener argument, and one returns a promise.
    The former is useful for C++ code and the latter is useful for JS code. In practice only the
    listener variant needs to be implemented, and the promise variant is a wrapper around it.

    The original function should be deprecated and removed, but that doesn't happen in this patch.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D308411

